      "body": "Follow-up after this lands: Muse Spark picks this up together with #5160 once `moe_dispatch_combine` is enabled in `MuseSparkModel.Config.local_compile_regions` (one line). Combined with #5160 on the Muse Spark stack (#5432-#5434): -4.6 ms per 2-layer fwd+bwd at 4k.\n",
